} Extend via declaration merging:Message Transformer convertToLlm transforms app messages to LLM-compatible format:import { defaultConvertToLlm, convertAttachments } from '@mariozechner/pi-web-ui'; // defaultConvertToLlm handles:
// - UserMessageWithAttachments → user message with image/text content blocks
